{"server":"cn","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_ex03_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_ex03","title":"采访环节","storyCode":"OF-EX3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex03_end.txt","sourceHash":"848ac2da36fc7b8df78366e876b3bfda2558190f20212a2f959194003a6832bf","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才是不是地震了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我们离舞台这么近哎！看到了吗！？你看到D.D.D.的表情了吗！？她是怎么做到的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经下台了啦，你不要老是这么......等等，这不是又在震了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，说不定是低音炮的缘故......慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"哎...哎？你也察觉到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"别问那么多了，快跟我走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要挤啊！离我远点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你踩着我的脚了！！滚开啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有人晕倒了！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么突然都躁动起来，难道真的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"......是大帝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，天气不错。"},{"type":"narration","text":"（欢呼声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝！是真人！！啊啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"别蠢了！这都什么时候了，你竟然还在意地震！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是，看见大帝，等等，我有点，喘不过气......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生，这边请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"各位观众！请退后！退至线后！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那个萨弗拉年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，让他们靠近点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"可是大帝先生，您一会还有演出，如果出了什么意外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"意外？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"枪击，刺杀，绑架，自杀威胁，意外是指这些东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"这些东西能阻止什么？阻止我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"不，它们会变成我舞台的一部分，就像语言的意义被节奏消解，你明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"简单来说就是节目效果。放轻松，塞壬唱片绝对不会追究你们失责。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"（欢呼声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝！！大帝！！大帝！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，总算来了，快，不要紧张，放轻松，大胆点，相信你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么西哥伦比亚的说唱之神，你，你就是个痞子，一个走狗屎运的幸运儿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"大声点，伙计，大声说话！喂，萨弗拉人，不要赶他走，把麦克风给他。不要慌，这里听我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你毁了我们的生活，你却坐拥那么多产业，你......你该去死！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_022","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——他拔出了一把弩！快躲开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不怪我，对，都是你的错，你所谓的说唱帝国建立在多少歌手的牺牲之下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么大帝啊，吃屎去吧，你这只下作的企鹅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，让我想想，到底是谁在耍一些不入流的小手段？媒体，舆论，人身攻击，还有枪杀，哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为在下水道和垃圾堆里打一圈滚我就认不出你了吗？对那些年轻人开枪让你满足吗，“歌手”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是我恰好有那么点看不顺眼，你们又会继续“排除”掉多少不合口味的新星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"然后把捞来的钞票堆在自己的澡盆里，唾弃着整个哥伦比亚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！给我去死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"快保护大帝先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生中弹了，快......欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"开枪的是大帝先生？那家伙的弩被打飞了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"哒哒哒哒哒，哒！砰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪。同你废话了这么多，枪口冒烟的人怎么是我？猜猜看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"是因为你太没种，还是我光芒万丈，你睁不开眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕——呃——你随身带着铳械......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"如果一个人每天多死个几次，就会养成随身携带武器的好习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"表情古怪的游客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——你以为，只有我一个人吗？想想你过去招惹的敌人，你走不出这座汐斯塔市的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"我的过去比这边虚假的海洋还要宽广，你说的敌人又在哪个犄角旮旯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生！观众里面混着很多他们的同伙，我们处理不过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，不要这么慌张。你们就维护好现场的秩序，剩下的交给专业人士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"比如我的，企鹅物流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎么记得我们是来度假的？姑且问一下，有加班费吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"在旅店呆了这么久，的确可以适当运动一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"因为德克萨......因为“空”你一直待在宾馆里看书嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......好像是还有这个约定。战斗的时候反应得过来吗，德克萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，这里完工了，要帮我订明天最前排的套票哟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保镖","speakerId":"avg_npc_020","isRemote":false,"text":"大帝先生，这、这些人是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"就当我们是老板......是大帝先生的私人保镖吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们是个物流公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"本来我们的业务扩展就很丰富嘛。之前不是还买了一家爵士乐酒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"还有那些总是被当成沙包的叙拉古黑帮，不过最近安分得有些诡异。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我们每个月要在龙门打多少次架？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"论斗殴和火并，我们才是行家里手，最顶级的，无人能及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的观众","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老子等这一刻好久了！西边的企鹅！你既然敢光明正大地出现，就等死吧！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们是成立了一个贼喊捉贼协会吗？好吧，反正也和我想的差不太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯，动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"明白——啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"——明白了！我上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克萨斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可颂"]}]}
